{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "help-pr-mobile-apis-only",
    "name": "Help PR — Mobile APIs only",
    "description": "Postman collection for **`/api/mobile/*`** only.\n\n**Partner app**\n- `POST /api/mobile/partner/register` — JSON, no auth\n- `POST /api/mobile/partner/login` — JSON, no auth\n- `PUT /api/mobile/partner/update` — **multipart/form-data only**, Bearer required\n\n**Setup**\n1. Set `baseUrl` (e.g. `http://localhost:5001`)\n2. Replace **`stateId`**, **`cityId`**, **`areaId`**, **`categoryId`**, **`serviceId`**, **`subscriptionPlanId`** with real Mongo ObjectIds from your DB (or run State/City/Area + catalog + subscription-plan APIs from Help-PR-All-APIs).\n3. Run **Register** or **Login** — saves `{{token}}` and `{{email}}`\n4. **Update partner** — Body → form-data only (do not set Content-Type manually)\n\n**Nested JSON in form fields:** `bank_account`, `partner_documents`, `partner_services`, `partner_subscription` as text (JSON strings).\n\n**Response:** `{ success, status, message, data }`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Partner",
      "description": "Partner mobile app — `routes/mobile/partner/index.js`",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const t = j?.data?.auth_token;",
                  "  if (t) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', t);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', t);",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?._id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('partnerId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?.email) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('email', String(j.data.email));",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Priya\",\n  \"date_of_birth\": \"2003-05-23\",\n  \"phone_number\": \"+916309654123\",\n  \"email\": \"partner.mobile+{{$timestamp}}@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Priya@123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "register"]
            },
            "description": "**POST /api/mobile/partner/register**\n\n- No Authorization\n- Creates partner (`verification_status` 1, `is_active` false)\n- Auto-assigns **basic** subscription (`expires_at` null)\n- Response: `data` with `auth_token`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const t = j?.data?.auth_token;",
                  "  if (t) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', t);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', t);",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?._id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('partnerId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', String(j.data._id));",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (j?.data?.email) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('email', String(j.data.email));",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"device_token\": \"{{deviceToken}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "login"]
            },
            "description": "**POST /api/mobile/partner/login**\n\n- No Authorization\n- Allows pending partners for onboarding\n- Use `data.verification_status` (1=pending, 2=approved, 3=rejected), `data.is_active`\n- Do not use `/api/auth/login` for partner app"
          },
          "response": []
        },
