            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/mobile/partner/update",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "mobile", "partner", "update"]
            },
            "description": "**PUT /api/mobile/partner/update**\n\n**Required:** `Content-Type: multipart/form-data` (Postman Body → form-data; do not add Content-Type header manually).\n\n**Bearer** `{{token}}` — updates logged-in partner only.\n\n**Text fields:** name, date_of_birth, gender, email, phone_number, experience, state_id, city_id, area_id, pincode, address, device_token, password, confirm_password\n\n**JSON as text:** bank_account, partner_services, partner_documents, partner_subscription (or flat subscription_plan_id)\n\n**Files:** image (512 KB max), vehicle_registration, police_verification_certificate, pan_card, driving_license, aadhar_card\n\n**Collection variables:** Set real ObjectIds for stateId, cityId, areaId, categoryId, serviceId, subscriptionPlanId before testing location/catalog/subscription rows."
